{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In an increasingly oppressive world, a magpie feeds her only remaining child amidst a city of lackluster sightseers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take their vision and feed your son.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WELCOME TO MAGEYE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/5a0d5ad6cbccf896acd4e1c530ab5dfb.gif?t=1759922610\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/5a0d5ad6cbccf896acd4e1c530ab5dfb.poster.avif?t=1759922610\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following a tragedy and being forced to tend to the infected wounds of your only remaining kin, you explore a nameless dump of a city and reap the vision of uselessly sighted wanderers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/7ce99fd4e49b4694c448afa59a42c517.poster.avif?t=1759922610\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/7ce99fd4e49b4694c448afa59a42c517.webm?t=1759922610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/7ce99fd4e49b4694c448afa59a42c517.mp4?t=1759922610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play out action sequences and bleed through vengeance after they condemned and failed you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed your beautiful son, as he cries because it hurts so much to breathe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch messy, loud visual novel sequences as pain grows.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh at their lawlessness, as they increasingly fail in ending you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suppress yourself, as emotion is weakness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gag and cry, because it hurts so much to see love die before you.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/0989b62b858ae83a2a5581ea3ea36cfc.poster.avif?t=1759922610\" width=640 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/0989b62b858ae83a2a5581ea3ea36cfc.webm?t=1759922610\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658230/extras/0989b62b858ae83a2a5581ea3ea36cfc.mp4?t=1759922610\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eye-catching, palatable arcade action.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Black and white pixelated visuals with a modernised retro Atari aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visual novel segments filled with emotionally charged, messy drawings and animations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two-leggeds designed with close accordance to the stupidity of their real-life counterparts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A city inspired by real world habitable landfills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dystopian advertisements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Excessive amounts of corpses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, edgy humor to make nasty sights easier to swallow.</p></li><li><p cl